1917: The Text-Based Adventure Game
By: John Cherny

If you're running windows, then the 1917Win.exe file should run on your machine.

If you're on Linux, the 1917Linux should run. You may have to run 'sudo chmod +x 1917Linux' to run file.

If you are stuck in the game, the 1917 Outline has all the details needed to complete the game.

Thank you for Playing!